.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="The NaCl Madelung-constant lattice sum is only conditionally convergent: a naive truncated sum over a growing cube of ions does not settle down as the cutoff grows, it oscillates. madelung_constant_nacl uses Evjen&#x27;s method (fractional boundary-charge weighting) to build a genuinely converging summation instead, and this example demonstrates both behaviors side by side against the literature value.">

